---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Community brand assets" description="Download the GenerativeAI Community logo and LinkedIn banner.">
  <article class="prose-precision">
    <h1 class="text-display-lg font-bold">Community brand assets</h1>
    <p>The logo and banner used on our LinkedIn community Page.</p>
    <h2>Logo</h2>
    <img src="/brand/logo.svg" alt="GenerativeAI Community G underscore logo" width="160" height="160" />
    <p><a href="/brand/logo.svg" download>SVG</a> · <a href="/brand/logo-2400.png" download>PNG · 2400 × 2400</a> · <a href="/brand/logo-1200.webp" download>WebP · 1200 × 1200</a> · <a href="/brand/logo-linkedin-600.png" download>Original LinkedIn PNG · 600 × 600</a></p>
    <h2>Banner</h2>
    <img src="/brand/banner.webp" alt="GenerativeAI Community — Build. Research. Apply." width="2171" height="724" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" />
    <p><a href="/brand/banner.png" download>Original PNG · 2171 × 724</a> · <a href="/brand/banner.webp" download>WebP · 2171 × 724</a> · <a href="/brand/banner.svg" download>SVG containing the original artwork</a></p>
    <p>The logo SVG is vector artwork. The banner SVG embeds the original high-resolution image to preserve its appearance; it is not a vector tracing.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
